aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"title_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"【神Code伴你行🎶──「出行碼」】 Travel QR Code","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3h124d000zbn5koghp340c:0003","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3h124d000zbn5koghp340c","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"description_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"無論係日常搭車，定係遇上服務受阻，掃一掃#出行碼，就可以睇到#最新車務狀況。如果遇到服務受阻，仲可以搵到港鐵替代路綫、其他交通工具同接駁巴士嘅資訊，出行就變得更方便無煩惱喇🕺 快啲去片▶️！ #神Code伴你行 #Cancan #出行碼 #最新車務狀況 #港鐵替代路綫 #接駁巴士資訊 The #TravelQRCode 📱 is available at MTR stations and on trains to ensure a worry-free journey! With a simple scan, you can get the latest service information in the Traffic News! And in case of service disruption, the “Travel QR Code” also provides information on alternative MTR routes, other transport options, and shuttle bus services, allowing you to easily plan your journey🕺! Let’s watch the video now▶️! #Cancan #TravelQRCode #LatestServiceStatus #AlternativeRoutes #ShuttleBusInformation","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3h124d000zbn5koghp340c:0004","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3h124d000zbn5koghp340c","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"author_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"displayName\": \"MTR Hong Kong\"}","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_gra